<title>JAPAN: ACOM TO SELL ITS SHARES THROUGH SECONDARY OFFERING.</title>
<headline>ACOM TO SELL ITS SHARES THROUGH SECONDARY OFFERING.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acom Co Ltd said on Monday that it had decided to sell up to five million of its shares through a secondary offering.  </p>
<p>Acom, a major consumer finance company, plans to sell three million of its shares in Japan and two million overseas, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Nikko Securities Co Ltd will be the lead underwriter of the secondary offering, the statement said.</p>
<p>The offer price had yet to be decided, it said.</p>
